# User units the desktop stage enables for every user (`systemctl --global enable` in
# images/fenoa/Containerfile). Fedora's 99-default-disable.preset disables every user unit no preset
# lists, so a global preset pass would otherwise turn these off.

# The AirPods plugin's daemon (Containerfile D3c)
enable librepods.service

# Bitwarden's browser integration for the Flatpak browsers (Containerfile D4)
enable fenoa-bitwarden-browsers.service
enable fenoa-bitwarden-browsers.path
